sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant MobileApp as Mobile App
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant DB as PostgreSQL DB
    participant Redis as Redis Cache

    MobileApp->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/register (Phone + E.164 + Public Key Bundle)
    API->>DB: Insert new device record (UUIDv7 + Device Public Keys)
    API->>Redis: Generate Ephemeral Refresh Token + Store SHA-256 Hash
    API-->>MobileApp: 201 Created (Access JWT + Refresh Token)
